    "deviceType": "foldable",
    "notes": "Verified real foldable posture/display states remain the measured source of truth. Closed clamshell widget/cover screens are outside Hero scope. V2 adds a broad synthetic geometry envelope for current book-style foldables and Surface Duo so the candidate can be stress-tested in one run before collecting the remaining real TestMU posture captures. iPhone Duo outer/inner geometries are included as synthetic posture/display-state sentinels using Apple pixel specs and an inferred 3x CSS scale; they are not treated as measured real-device evidence."
